abstract: "Source code and compact evidence for two worked RUL claim-traceability studies. The release adds post-result practical-equivalence bands, static maintenance-decision sensitivity, exploratory battery baselines, target-index sensitivity, an explicit analysis timeline, and an unexecuted independent comparator-study protocol. It does not establish model superiority, field reliability, optimized maintenance utility, or reporting-template efficacy."
keywords:
  - remaining useful life
  - C-MAPSS
  - battery aging
  - benchmark audit
  - preregistration
  - reproducibility
  - maintenance decision sensitivity
